## 11. Title-block notes

- Impregnation is a CORE-LOT process, not a plate-by-plate art project.
- Route A default. Route B only when named.
- No epoxy in a flight-like core.
- No hemp impregnation inside the sternum cup — the core stops at the sealed land.
- Genealogy: CORE-LOT / RESIN-LOT / ROUTE / FILM-GSM or SHOT-MASS / DATE / OUT-TIME.